        "_uid": "144cef9d-47f8-719d-34e0-b2d59b12158e",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In groups of 8-10 participants, each had hands-on sessions dealing with 8 commonly occurring situations such as asthmatic attacks, choking, bleeding, falls, safely and effectively. Three full days were required to deliver the course by a team of volunteers from the hospital, student nurses and doctors, the SPIE group, and CIME's team providing educational & technical support and organisational know-how. A Magnifiscientific, Aga Khan-do achievement for the greater good.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
