    "show_share": true,
    "description": "CIME's highly successful 'Teachers First Responders Course' was adapted to meet the needs of the 170 staff of the MagnifiScience Centre to allow them to respond with confidence to the medical emergencies that regularly occur in visitors to the Centre.",
